- Enhance clarity for tasks related to user registration and login validation, specifically addressing how to handle common user errors like incorrect passwords.  
- Provide more detailed explanations of the expected user experience during donations, including how donations will be processed and expected interactions post-donation button click.  
- Group UI-related tasks together to streamline the development process, ensuring all HTML templates are gathered in one section with their specific implementations and design requirements.  
